4,0,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first... but I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf together. I'll do my best to be helpful.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"Hello, Daisuke. It is a pleasure to meet you all. Since we have no information yet, I believe the most rational approach is to observe how everyone interacts. Let us maintain a calm atmosphere for now.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A rational approach is a good start, Victoria. Though ""getting along"" is a lovely sentiment, Daisuke, we should remember that some of us are lying. I'll be watching to see whose mask slips first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready to find that wolf! I don't care about masks or being ""rational""—I'm just going to watch everyone closely. If anyone tries to trick us, I'll be the first one to call them out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Victoria. Since we lack concrete data, observation is our only reliable tool. Let us see how the conversation evolves before we draw any conclusions. I will be listening carefully to everyone's logic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Victoria and Ryuji. Observation seems like the safest way to start. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best to listen to everyone and notice if anything feels... wrong.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"It is natural to feel nervous, Daisuke. However, let us use that sensitivity to our advantage. I am curious if anyone has a specific method for identifying the werewolf or the possessed when the evidence is still thin.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,My method is simple: I look for the gaps. The wolf and the possessed often over-explain their logic to appear helpful. I'll be paying close attention to who is trying a bit too hard to blend in.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Over-explaining? That sounds like a lot of work! I'll just look for anyone who's acting fake or trying to hide something. I'm not letting the wolf get away with any tricks!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, your focus on over-explanation is a valid point, but we must be careful not to mistake a desire for clarity for deception. I will be looking for contradictions in statements as they emerge.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think you're all right. It's scary to think someone might be lying, but... I'll try to remember what Shunichi and Ryuji said. I'll just keep listening and try to be honest.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Honesty is a virtue, Daisuke, but we must remember that the werewolf will also strive to appear honest. I am interested to see how the group's dynamics shift once the Seer's first divination is revealed tomorrow.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Indeed, the Seer's information will be the first real catalyst. I wonder if the Seer will be bold enough to speak, or if they'll play it safe and let us stumble in the dark for a while.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"If the Seer is too scared to speak, we're just giving the wolf a head start! I hope they're brave enough to tell us what they found. I'm not going to just sit around and wait!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, bravery without a strategy is a risk. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they become an immediate target for the wolf. A measured approach to sharing information is more likely to ensure our survival.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Ryuji is right. It's probably safer for the Seer to be careful. I'll just... keep observing everyone and hope we can all stay safe tonight. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let us all remain vigilant and mindful of the patterns we have discussed. I look forward to seeing how the information unfolds tomorrow. Goodnight to you all.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"A peaceful night for some, a hunting ground for others. I'll be dreaming of which one of you will be the first to crack under the pressure. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not scared of any pressure! I'll be wide awake in my dreams, ready to catch the wolf tomorrow. Goodnight, everyone! I'm not letting anyone trick me!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I concur. Let us proceed to the night phase with a clear mind. I shall be analyzing the discourse of tomorrow to see if any inconsistencies arise. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
