31,1,,status,Takumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
32,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""WEREWOLF"",""alive"":true}"
33,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""POSSESSED"",""alive"":true}"
34,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
35,1,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""SEER"",""alive"":true}"
36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Good morning... I hope everyone slept okay. I... I have some information from last night. I'm a bit scared to say it, but I'm the Seer, and I found out that Shunichi is human.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, thank you for your courage in revealing your role so early. Confirming Shunichi as human provides us with a starting point, though we must consider if this is a genuine reveal or a strategic play.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, well. I didn't expect the Seer to be so eager to throw their identity to the wolves on the first morning. I appreciate the vote of confidence, Daisuke, though I'm sure you're just relieved to have a ""safe"" person to lean on.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, that was brave! If you're really the Seer, then we've already got one person we can trust. But if you're lying to trick us, I'll be the one to find out! @Shunichi, stop being so smug!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, claiming the Seer role this early is a high-risk move. While confirming Shunichi as human is helpful, we must analyze why you chose to reveal yourself now. Is this for the village's benefit, or a tactical diversion?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just wanted to help everyone as soon as possible. I was worried that if I waited, we might accidentally vote out someone innocent. I'm sorry if it seems too risky... I just want us to win.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your desire to protect the innocent is commendable, but in this game, transparency can be a weapon. @Ryuji, do you believe the timing of this reveal suggests a specific motive, or is it simply a reflection of Daisuke's personality?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, it's quite simple. Daisuke is playing the role of the frightened innocent to perfection. Whether he's a genuine Seer or a wolf trying to buy my loyalty, the result is the same: I'm ""safe."" It's a charmingly clumsy tactic.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just being mean! Daisuke is trying to help us, and you're just making fun of him! If you're so smart, why are you just sitting there? I believe Daisuke is telling the truth!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, emotional reactions are not evidence. @Daisuke, your intention may be pure, but we must remain objective. If you are the Seer, you have provided a lead; if not, you have created a false sense of security.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not trying to trick anyone. I really am the Seer. I know I'm not very confident, but I promise I'm telling the truth. Please... I just want us to find the werewolf together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your sincerity is evident, but we must remain analytical. If you are the Seer, we have a confirmed human in Shunichi. However, we must consider if a werewolf would use this same ""fragile"" persona to secure an ally.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're overthinking the ""persona."" Whether Daisuke is a trembling Seer or a wolf in sheep's clothing, the fact remains that I've been cleared. Now, let's see who among the rest of you is too eager to agree with him.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just trying to act cool while everyone else is actually working! I'm agreeing with Daisuke because he's the only one being honest and helpful. You're just being a jerk for no reason!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your trust in Daisuke is based on a feeling of honesty, which is subjective. We must consider that a Werewolf or Possessed could easily mimic a fragile demeanor to avoid suspicion. @Daisuke, who will you divine tonight?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not sure yet. I'll probably choose someone who seems... suspicious, or maybe someone who can help us lead the group. I'm really scared, but I'll do my best to find the wolf tonight.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is understandable. However, for the village's sake, I suggest you prioritize someone whose role remains ambiguous. @Ryuji, @Takumi, since we have no contradictions yet, who do you suspect most before we vote?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're forced to vote without a clear culprit, I'll play along. @Takumi, your blind trust in Daisuke is almost touching, but it's also a perfect shield for a wolf. I suspect your ""honesty"" is a bit too loud.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just trying to turn the tables because you're bored! I'm not a shield for anyone; I'm just the only one here with the guts to trust someone! I'm voting for you if you keep acting like this!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, your suspicion of Takumi is based on his temperament, not on a logical contradiction. However, @Daisuke's early reveal remains the most anomalous event. Without a counter-claim, we lack certainty. I suggest we vote cautiously to avoid losing a potential Seer.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
